          "ruleId": "crux/installer-gate-is-not-a-required-check",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Branch protection on main requires exactly [\"ci / gate\",\"workspace-test\"]. install_test.sh is a separate workflow and is not in that list, so a red installer gate does not block a merge. On this PR it is green (34 s, run 35115773219), so this is a statement about the mechanism and not about the current state. Recorded, not blocked: adding a required check is a repository-settings change with its own cost (a paths-filtered required check never reports on PRs that do not touch those paths, which is how a required check comes to sit pending forever), so the honest note is that the gate is advisory today."
          },
          "locations": [
